# Code navigation

| # | Rule |
|---|------|
| F1 | LSP is mandatory. Use go-to-definition, find-references, and rename-symbol for symbols. |

If TypeScript language service is unavailable, fix that before large refactors. Use Grep/Glob only for string literals, path patterns, and docs — not as a substitute for symbol navigation.
